</ul>            </div>          </nav>          <!-- GoC NAVIGATION ENDS -->                    <nav id="wb-bc" property="breadcrumb">            <h2>You are here:</h2>            <div class="container">              <ol class="breadcrumb">                <li>                  <a href="http://www.canada.ca/en/index.html">Canada.ca</a>                </li>                <li><a href="https://www.international.gc.ca/world-monde/index.aspx?lang=eng">Canada and the world</a></li><li><a href="https://www.international.gc.ca/world-monde/international_relations-relations_internationales/index.aspx?lang=eng">Foreign policy and international relations </a></li><li><a href="https://www.international.gc.ca/world-monde/international_relations-relations_internationales/sanctions/index.aspx?lang=eng">Canadian sanctions</a></li><li>Consolidated Canadian Autonomous Sanctions List</li>              </ol>            </div>          </nav>        </header>                                  <main property="mainContentOfPage" resource="#wb-main" class="container" typeof="WebPageElement">        <!-- MainContentStart -->        <!-- content_start -->        <!--  --> <!-- REVIEW -->        <script type="text/javascript">

//**********************************************************
// Query to decode parameters in the url (i.e. like the dates)
//**********************************************************


function getQueryParams(qs) {
const params = {};
const urlParams = new URLSearchParams(qs);
for (const [key, value] of urlParams.entries()) {
params[key] = value;
}
return params;
}



//**********************************************************
// When document is ready
//**********************************************************
$( document ).ready( function() {

	var query = getQueryParams( document.location.search );

	if ( query ) {

		var details = $('#details-filter');
		details.attr('open', 'open');

		if (query.regulation  != null) {
			$( "#dt_country" ).val( query.regulation );
		}


		setTimeout( function(){ $( "#form-filter-datatable" ).submit(); }, 3000 );
	}

});

</script><script type="text/javascript">
(function() {
  var normalize = function(s) {
    return (s || "").normalize("NFD").replace(/[\u0300-\u036f]/g, "").toLowerCase();
  };

  var init = function() {
    if (!$.fn.dataTable || !$.fn.dataTable.isDataTable("#sanctions-table")) { return false; }

    var table = $("#sanctions-table").DataTable();
    if (table.settings()[0]._accentInit) { return true; }
    table.settings()[0]._accentInit = true;

    // Accent-insensitive filter
    $.fn.dataTable.ext.search.push(function(cfg, row) {
      var q = normalize($("#sanctions-table_filter input").val());
      return cfg.nTable.id !== "sanctions-table" || !q || row.some(function(c) { return normalize(String(c)).indexOf(q) !== -1; });
    });

    // Bypass native search
    $("#sanctions-table_filter input").off("keyup.accent").on("keyup.accent", function() { table.search("").draw(); });
    return true;
  };

  // Poll until WET-BOEW/DataTables is ready
  var t = 0;
  var i = setInterval(function() { if (init() || ++t > 50) { clearInterval(i); } }, 200);
}());
</script><div class="row"><div class="col-md-12"><h1 property="name" id="wb-cont">Consolidated Canadian Autonomous Sanctions List</h1><ul class="list-inline pull-right"><li><a role="button" class="btn btn-default btn-sm" href="/world-monde/assets/pdfs/international_relations-relations_internationales/sanctions/sema-lmes.pdf">View as <abbr title="Portable document format">PDF</abbr> (13.3 MB)</a></li><li><a role="button" class="btn btn-default btn-sm" href="/world-monde/assets/office_docs/international_relations-relations_internationales/sanctions/sema-lmes.xml">View as <abbr title="Extensible Markup Language">XML</abbr> (1.7 MB)</a></li></ul><div class="clearfix"></div><p>The Consolidated Canadian Autonomous Sanctions List includes individuals and entities subject to specific sanctions regulations made under the&nbsp;<em>Special Economic Measures Act</em> (SEMA) and the&nbsp;<em>Justice for Victims of Corrupt Foreign Officials Act</em> (JVCFOA).</p><p>The inclusion of these names on this list is for administrative purposes only. The consolidated list is not a regulation, and it does not have force of law.</p><p>The current version of this list is provided in HTML, PDF, and XML formats.</p><p>Please note that this list was last <strong>updated on September 22, 2026</strong>. Regulations are updated frequently; therefore this version of the list may not be up-to-date.</p><p>For accurate information on which provisions from a given sanctions regulation apply to a specific individual or entity, reference must be made to the&nbsp;<a href="/world-monde/international_relations-relations_internationales/sanctions/legislation-lois.aspx?lang=eng">relevant regulations in which that individual or entity is listed</a>.</p></div><div class="col-md-12"><details id="details-filter" open=""><summary class="btn btn-primary" style="text-align: left;">Filter Options</summary><p class="mrgn-tp-md">Use filters to below options to change the focus of your results in following data table</p><form id="form-filter-datatable" class="wb-tables-filter" name="form-filter-datatable" data-bind-to="sanctions-table"><div class="row"><div class="col-md-6"><div class="form-group"><label for="dt_country">Regulation</label><select id="dt_country" class="form-control maxwidth" name="dt_country" data-column="0"><option selected="selected" value="">All regulations</option><option value="Belarus">Belarus</option><option value="China">China</option><option value="Extremist Settler Violence">Extremist Settler Violence</option><option value="Guatemala">Guatemala</option><option value="Haiti">Haiti</option><option value="Hamas Terrorist Attacks">Hamas Terrorist Attacks</option><option value="Iran">Iran</option><option value="Justice for Victims of Corrupt Foreign Officials Regulations">Justice for Victims of Corrupt Foreign Officials Regulations</option><option value="Moldova">Moldova</option><option value="Myanmar">Myanmar (Burma)</option><option value="Nicaragua">Nicaragua</option><option value="Russia">Russia</option><option value="South Sudan">South Sudan</option><option value="Sudan">Sudan</option><option value="Sri Lanka">Sri Lanka</option><option value="Syria">Syria</option><option value="Ukraine">Ukraine</option><option value="Venezuela">Venezuela</option><option value="Zimbabwe">Zimbabwe</option></select></div></div></div><div class="row"><div class="col-md-6"><ul class="list-inline"><li><button aria-controls="dataset-filter" class="btn btn-primary" type="submit"> Filter </button></li><li><button class="btn btn-default" type="reset">Clear</button></li></ul></div></div></form></details></div><div class="col-md-12 mrgn-tp-lg"><div data-wb-jsonmanager="{ &quot;url&quot;: [      &quot;https://www.international.gc.ca/world-monde/assets/office_docs/international_relations-relations_internationales/sanctions/sanctions-consolidated-list-eng.json#/data&quot;],     &quot;name&quot;: &quot;merged-source&quot;}"></div><table class="wb-tables table table-striped table-bordere